<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-29T10:16:28.272Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:16:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Houthis have intensified attacks, striking Yemen's Aden airport and firing a ballistic missile toward Saudi Arabia's Ras Tanura refinery, while Saudi-led forces continue intercepting Houthi missiles aimed at the Eastern Province. Saudi airstrikes have hit a market in northern Yemen and a petrol station, causing civilian casualties. Egypt's parliament has approved military support to defend Saudi Arabia, linking the conflict to broader regional involvement. Russian satellites are now being used to guide Houthi strikes on Saudi targets, contributing to higher oil prices. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOSlpYejlRTmd1MFprTGxzTHhIQi1taDhJVkMtTThYN1Y5UktONWZxcVM5TEJ2Sy1Jd25QZXFCem5uNDkzOGU3Z0NONzE1V0ZPT2E2QlJTdjZreDg0eXA5Z21MandpYmI3azQ5Q0h4azVTdHpYQnVQVGdYR3pEajBid0QtT0taZl9OVktOSUhIWjl6eGdqYlJ5RFZOd3p1LVRkVjVCVg?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOaGJJTHU3MkMzMHhOcERIQ3VKUldFLXhvSy1FZXVYMDNwWTR1SVNmWnlIcEpHSldraENHSjFtNmRJQ3U4eElfQkZKaTQwcnc4UUJfUGtQMUZSUkUybWxvZUdVMWZSTTNESDVfUFZLbzg3aENKb09GS3UyU2VlczRrZHh1eE9hcE1xMkhnRVNBU3U1MFZZWkxlbG5WbEI?oc=5&quot;&gt;NDTV&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;アラブニュース&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;تسنیم&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQMUttdjlFX1NnTi01X2NGcy0ycl9wa1R5R0JTcnZXUFNtS0xEMWNPbk5wZjZsblhieXBhc25nN2NGaW15MlJDdWdLUVdabGFNaFM5S1ZSRkp1em45RnFvekxWUUNZTERwa21zMW5jZ1hZenNJek4xZXctMmhnMW1TcGoyTmV2Vkh1b1RRb1dKTE5oR0R1ek1BeG53?oc=5&quot;&gt;The National&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQQ2IzZnBTYnRjcy1LMWtLRm5MMHh4czZCMFNSbVRvcEpLV1FBY01rY3A2RV